  "bio": "Beneath the Alter is a hypermetal / postpunk band from New York City. Started by vocalist and producer Xavier Bravo as a cover band in 2018, its first shows were at family parties and church.\n\nXavier is joined by his brother, rhythm guitarist Zane Bravo, and lead guitarist Sebas, who began working with the band in 2023. From riffs and lyrics to recording, this is music built together.",
